<comment>Attribute- and relationship syntax extension:

Attributes can have postfixes in their name:
  [L]	Language-dependant. 
  [N]	Multivalued
  [T]	Temporal (historicised)
(can appear in any combination)
These attributes violate strict 1 NF and have to be resolved in the data model with detail tables. (with language, period or sequence-nr)

Relationships with [T] are temporal and have to be resolved in the data model with an period-dependent intersection entity.</comment>
